View Counter Banner: Positioned at the top of the viewport (top: 0), displaying real-time page views fetched via an asynchronous API call.

Navigation Bar: Positioned right below the view counter (top: 32px) with blur backdrop effects. Contains jump-links to all main sections (#about, #experience, #skills, #certifications, #projects, #education, #languages).

