Dynamic Functionality (JavaScript)
Live View Counter API Integration:

Fires a POST request on DOMContentLoaded to an AWS Lambda Function URL ([https://57xd6ainse4to36inwwb2pfqou0ofgjo.lambda-url.ap-southeast-1.on.aws/](https://57xd6ainse4to36inwwb2pfqou0ofgjo.lambda-url.ap-southeast-1.on.aws/)).

Parses the response payload for view_count and updates the DOM dynamically using local number formatting (toLocaleString()). Displays 'N/A' on failure.

Smooth Scrolling:

Intercepts navigation click events and applies smooth scroll behaviors (element.scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth' })).

Scroll Reveal Animations:

Utilizes an IntersectionObserver to trigger fade-in and slide-up animations (translateY) as cards and timeline elements scroll into view.
